flowchart TD
  A[Public normal Restaurant menu] -->|Open full 3D menu| B[GET /api/restaurants/:slug/menu/3d]
  B --> C[Only active + available + 3D enabled dishes]
  C --> D[Current dish GLB]
  C --> E[Preload previous GLB]
  C --> F[Preload next GLB]
  D --> G[ExplodedDishCanvas]
  G --> H[GSAP Assemble / Explode]
  H --> I{Navigation}
  I -->|Next / swipe left| J[Explode outgoing]
  I -->|Previous / swipe right| K[Explode outgoing]
  J --> L[Switch selected dish route]
  K --> L
  L --> M[Incoming GLB auto-assembles]

  RA[Restaurant Admin] --> N[/restaurant-admin/3d-animation]
  N --> O[GET own dish animation]
  O --> P[Edit layer participation / XYZ / sequence / timing / easing]
  P --> Q[Live local preview]
  Q --> R[PATCH own dish animation]
  R --> S[Backend validation + req.managedRestaurantId]
  S --> T[(MongoDB MenuItem.threeD)]
  T --> B
